<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final day</p>
<p>of the third and final test between South Africa and India at</p>
<p>the Wanderers on Monday:</p>
<p>India first innings 410 (R.Dravid 148, S.Ganguly 73)</p>
<p>South Africa first innings 321 (S.Pollock 79; J.Srinath</p>
<p>5-104)</p>
<p>India second innings 266-8 declared (R.Dravid 81, S.Ganguly</p>
<p>60, N.Mongia 50)</p>
<p>South Africa second innings (overnight 4-1)</p>
<p> A.Hudson b Kumble			    3</p>
<p> G.Kirsten c Rathore b Prasad	     1</p>
<p> A.Bacher b Prasad			   23</p>
<p> D.Cullinan not out			 122</p>
<p> H.Cronje run out			     6</p>
<p> B.McMillan c Sub b Srinath		 2</p>
<p> S.Pollock b Srinath			  0</p>
<p> D.Richardson c Azharuddin b Kumble     7</p>
<p> L.Klusener c Dravid b Kumble	    49</p>
<p> A.Donald not out			     0</p>
<p> Extras (lb-13 b-1 nb-1)		   15</p>
<p> Total (for eight wickets)		228</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-4 2-4 3-49 4-71 5-76 6-78 7-95 8-222</p>
<p>Bowling: Srinath 24-6-89-2 (nb1), Prasad 15-1-59-2, Kumble</p>
<p>23-7-40-3, Ganesh 2-0-8-0, Tendulkar 2-0-18-0, Ganguly 2-2-0-0</p>
<p>First test (Durban) - South Africa won by 328 runs</p>
<p>Second test (Cape Town) - South Africa won by 282 runs</p>
<p>South Africa win series 2-0.</p>
</text>
